体を脱ぎ捨てて 今輪廻に帰る時
Shedding this body, now is the time to return to the cycle of reincarnation.

516
00:48:22,174 --> 00:48:26,174
回りゅーれ ガラエ サダナレ アマレ
Swirling, breaking away, calming down, overflowing,

517
00:48:26,174 --> 00:48:30,174
ディレヒ ジュマギ ガナショラ
letting go, spinning around, dancing away.

518
00:48:30,174 --> 00:48:34,174
回りゅーれ ガラエ サダナレ アマレ
Swirling, breaking away, calming down, overflowing,

519
00:48:34,174 --> 00:48:38,174
手に触れて 覚醒
touching it, awakening.

520
00:49:07,174 --> 00:49:15,174
目を潰って 風を救って
Closing my eyes, catching the wind,

521
00:49:16,174 --> 00:49:24,174
身を溶かして 金を鳴らして
melting my body, ringing the bell,

522
00:49:46,174 --> 00:49:53,174
回りゅーれ ガラエ サダナレ アマレ
Swirling, breaking away, calming down, overflowing,

523
00:49:53,174 --> 00:50:00,674
ディレヒ ジュマギ ガナショラ
letting go, spinning around, dancing away.

524
00:50:01,735 --> 00:50:04,195
十字架がしゃらまはり
Crosses clatter and spin around,

525
00:50:04,195 --> 00:50:08,555
いわれがやへ さばかれ あまれ どらひ
heading to where reasons lie, judged and rained down,

526
00:50:08,555 --> 00:50:11,335
十字架がしゃらまはり
crosses clatter and spin around,

527
00:50:11,335 --> 00:50:18,055
いわれがやへ さばかれ あまれ どらひ 天に吠えて
heading to where reasons lie, judged, howling to the heavens—

528
00:50:18,775 --> 00:50:23,175
覚醒 レイメイは
Awakening, the dawn is...

529
00:50:25,175 --> 00:50:31,555
何度も 埋もれどへを 駆ける 歌のソウル
Running again and again toward a place to live, the soul of song—

530
00:50:32,755 --> 00:50:38,295
闇を越えて 飛び出せ
jump across the darkness and leap out!

531
00:50:56,135 --> 00:50:58,495
十字架がしゃらまはり
Crosses clatter and spin around,

532
00:50:58,495 --> 00:51:02,695
いわれがやへ さばかれ あまれ どらひ
heading to where reasons lie, judged and rained down,

533
00:51:02,695 --> 00:51:05,375
十字架がしゃらまはり
crosses clatter and spin around,

534
00:51:05,375 --> 00:51:06,575
いわれがやへ
heading to where reasons lie—

535
00:51:22,808 --> 00:51:27,908
いついつまでも 照らすはこの地で 歌おうわ
No matter when, let's sing in this illuminated land,

536
00:51:28,448 --> 00:51:31,768
胸を打ち震わせる 感動を
to make the emotion that shakes our chests echo,

537
00:51:31,768 --> 00:51:34,528
鳴らすように
ringing out,

538
00:51:34,528 --> 00:51:37,988
いつの日か もしも灯火が消え去ったって
so that even if someday the lamp's light goes out,

539
00:51:37,988 --> 00:51:41,168
人が生きていくなら 歌おうわ
if people are to keep living, let's sing—

540
00:51:41,168 --> 00:51:45,628
心は 死なない すべてが壊れても
our hearts will never die, even if everything breaks!

541
00:51:59,628 --> 00:52:02,028
行き止まった 牢獄から
From a dead-end prison,

542
00:52:02,028 --> 00:52:05,048
香り出すのは 火薬と死の匂いさ
what exudes is the scent of gunpowder and death.

543
00:52:05,048 --> 00:52:09,148
じゃあ 進め
Well then, move forward!

544
00:52:11,468 --> 00:52:16,528
朽ち果てた 荒野なりに 吹きすさぶ風
In the ruined wasteland, the raging wind

545
00:52:16,528 --> 00:52:20,888
哀しみ責めるなら 叫べ
if sorrow torments you, scream out!

546
00:52:20,888 --> 00:52:22,508
ぜんぶ
Everything—

547
00:52:23,708 --> 00:52:29,188
朝が来たって 振り続く 雨だとざす
Even if morning comes, the rain keeps falling and locking in—

548
00:52:29,188 --> 00:52:35,628
おもかげ 狭い あの歌を 今あと片も無き
memories... that narrow song, now leaving not a trace,

549
00:52:35,628 --> 00:52:36,508
この地で
in this land.

550
00:52:37,008 --> 00:52:41,588
歌おうわ わずかでも かすかでも
Let's sing, even if just a little, even if faintly,

551
00:52:41,588 --> 00:52:45,808
また希望を 信じたいから
because I still want to believe in hope.

552
00:52:45,808 --> 00:52:53,688
奏でだし 溢れ出す あの笑顔を取り戻せるなら
If I can bring back that smiling face that overflows with melody,

553
00:52:53,688 --> 00:52:58,488
私の歌は やまない
my song will never stop.

554
00:52:58,988 --> 00:53:04,368
この声枯らすまで
Until this voice grows hoarse—

555
00:53:13,608 --> 00:53:18,788
変わり果てても 変わらないものがあると
Even if it transforms completely, believing there is something that never changes,

556
00:53:18,788 --> 00:53:25,468
目を閉じ 浮かべて あなは 叫べ
close your eyes, picture it, and scream out—

557
00:53:25,468 --> 00:53:31,768
まだ共に鳴らせる 心があるなら
if there is still a heart that can echo together,

558
00:53:31,768 --> 00:53:35,548
何ひとつ 無駄じゃない
not a single thing is in vain.

559
00:53:35,548 --> 00:53:42,768
この歌も この愛も 耳色のがらんどをも
This song too, this love too, and the echoing emptiness of my ears—

560
00:53:42,768 --> 00:53:48,768
どこまでも 響いてたとしても 今はただ空しいだけ
even if they resonate to the ends of the earth, right now they feel so empty,

561
00:53:48,768 --> 00:53:53,768
でも願いを込めて
but putting a wish into it—

562
00:53:59,668 --> 00:54:07,568
人の歌を 絶やしたものが 人の主役
The one who extinguished human song, the protagonist of humanity—

563
00:54:07,568 --> 00:54:15,368
私 知っても 歌おうわ
even knowing that, let's sing!

564
00:54:16,968 --> 00:54:21,568
さあ 後ろ盾も無くこの地で
Come on, without any backing in this land,

565
00:54:21,568 --> 00:54:27,568
歌おうわ ただ強く なお強く まだ希望を
let's sing, just stronger, still stronger, still holding onto hope,

566
00:54:27,568 --> 00:54:33,568
信じたいから 奏でだし 溢れ出す
because I want to believe in it, melody starts overflowing,

567
00:54:33,568 --> 00:54:38,568
あの笑顔を取り戻せるなら
if I can bring back that smile,

568
00:54:38,568 --> 00:54:43,568
私の歌は やまない この声枯らすまで
my song will never stop, until this voice grows hoarse.

569
00:54:45,768 --> 00:54:51,568
滅びたこの街で
In this ruined city—

570
00:54:59,568 --> 00:55:02,068
叫べよ 叫べ
scream out, scream!

571
00:55:19,733 --> 00:55:22,293
はあ、ありがとう！
Phew, thank you!

572
00:55:24,693 --> 00:55:32,693
いや、ここまで駆け足でたくさんの歌を聞いていただきましたが、みんな楽しんでますか？
We rushed through and listened to so many songs so far, but are you all having fun?

573
00:55:34,093 --> 00:55:38,693
わためはめちゃくちゃ楽しいです！
Watame is having an absolute blast!

574
00:55:40,173 --> 00:55:44,673
いや、本当に歌を歌わせてくれてありがとうございます。
Yeah, thank you so much for letting me sing.

575
00:55:45,013 --> 00:55:50,653
そしてなんと、次の曲でラストになります。
And amazingly, the next song will be our last.

576
00:55:50,843 --> 00:55:59,853
寂しい！寂しい！寂しい！
I'm lonely! So lonely! So lonely!

577
00:56:00,753 --> 00:56:03,113
本当に寂しいんかってね。
Are you really that lonely, huh?

578
00:56:03,913 --> 00:56:08,293
寂しい、けど！ここで嬉しいお知らせがあります。
I am, but! I have some happy news to share.

579
00:56:08,793 --> 00:56:17,693
今から歌わさせていただく曲は、わためが作詞をした新曲『Revival』という曲です。
The song I'm about to sing is my new self-written track, "Revival".

580
00:56:18,343 --> 00:56:36,343
そして、わためセカンドライブでお披露目をした『メーデーメーデー』『フィーチャリング 森カリオペ』が音源になりまして、『リバイバル』と一緒にこのあと24時、24時から楽曲配信されます！
And what's more, "Mayday Mayday" featuring Mori Calliope, premiered at my 2nd live, is now available as a single! It'll be released digitally right at midnight alongside "Revival"!

581
00:56:38,643 --> 00:56:47,343
『リバイバル』と『メーデーメーデー』『フィーチャリング 森カリオペ』是非買ってください、よろしくお願いします！
Please make sure to buy "Revival" and "Mayday Mayday" featuring Mori Calliope. Thank you so much!

582
00:56:49,843 --> 00:57:07,843
では、歌うか。寂しいけど、みんなに聴いてもらいたい新曲、魂を込めて歌いたいと思います。それでは聴いてください。新曲『リバイバル』。
Well then, time to sing. Even though I'm sad, I want to put my soul into this new song I want you all to hear. Please listen to my new song, "Revival".

583
00:57:46,635 --> 00:57:48,415
壊したい衝動
An urge to destroy,

584
00:57:48,715 --> 00:57:50,495
崩れていく感情
emotions falling apart,

585
00:57:50,735 --> 00:57:52,855
彩、失った眼光
gaze stripped of all color,

586
00:57:52,955 --> 00:57:55,635
突きつける銃口
muzzle pointed straight at me.

587
00:57:55,995 --> 00:57:59,775
マジメな者が馬鹿を見る世界
A world where the earnest play the fool,

588
00:58:00,135 --> 00:58:03,515
全てを僕から奪ってよ
take everything away from me.

589
00:58:04,035 --> 00:58:09,595
どうしてアイツは見下し笑うの？
Why do they look down and laugh at me?

590
00:58:09,995 --> 00:58:13,435
叫んだ怒号も届かない
My shouted roars don't even reach them.

591
00:58:13,915 --> 00:58:16,755
泣き叫んで泣き喚いて
Crying, screaming, howling,

592
00:58:16,755 --> 00:58:19,735
救いを求めて
begging for salvation,

593
00:58:19,835 --> 00:58:23,315
切り裂いて振り払って絡まる糸を解いて
slashing and shaking off, untangling the threads,

594
00:58:23,755 --> 00:58:28,635
囚われて縛られて消えない痛みに
trapped and bound by unending pain,

595
00:58:28,635 --> 00:58:32,655
その手で抱きしめて生きる意味を教えて
hold me tight and teach me life's meaning!

596
00:58:44,813 --> 00:58:46,553
本当は愛したいな
The truth is, I want to love,

597
00:58:46,793 --> 00:58:52,813
この胸を焦がすほど 夢を笑われても
burning this chest, even if my dreams are mocked,

598
00:58:52,893 --> 00:58:58,613
努力否定されても 踏みつけられてでも
even if my efforts are denied, even if I'm trampled down,

599
00:58:58,933 --> 00:59:01,593
(笑って 笑って)
(Laugh, just laugh)

600
00:59:02,633 --> 00:59:07,633
何が正解なの？僕にはわからないよ
What is the right answer? I have no idea.

601
00:59:07,813 --> 00:59:11,413
感情なんてもういらないよ
I don't need emotions anymore.

602
00:59:11,813 --> 00:59:17,173
涙など枯れ果てて この世を憎んで
Tears run dry, cursing this world,

603
00:59:17,173 --> 00:59:19,733
噛みついて傷つけて
biting and hurting,

604
00:59:19,833 --> 00:59:22,333
赤い眼に映して
reflecting in crimson eyes,

605
00:59:22,333 --> 00:59:25,593
記憶して刻み込んで消えない痛みを
memorizing and carving in the pain that won't fade,

606
00:59:26,353 --> 00:59:31,753
ねえもう誰でもいい 生きる意味を教えて
Hey, anyone is fine, teach me the meaning of life!

607
00:59:31,753 --> 00:59:33,093
今
Now!

608
00:59:51,713 --> 01:00:01,673
微かに聞こえる声 闇夜を切り裂く声
A faint voice is heard, a voice tearing through the dark night,

609
01:00:01,673 --> 01:00:04,168
さあ今一歩を踏み出せ
Now, take that step forward!

610
01:00:06,295 --> 01:00:09,355
切り裂く声
A voice that tears through...

611
01:00:11,315 --> 01:00:18,515
さあ 今 一歩を踏み出せ
Now, take that first step forward!

612
01:00:20,262 --> 01:00:24,712
重くても 辛くても
No matter how heavy or painful it is,

613
01:00:25,262 --> 01:00:28,962
もう一度 立ち上がれ！
stand up once again!

614
01:00:30,307 --> 01:00:34,667
駆け抜けて 手を伸ばして 光を求めて
Run through, reach out your hands, seeking the light.

615
01:00:35,062 --> 01:00:39,112
大丈夫、少しずつ ありのままで
It's alright, little by little, just as you are.

616
01:00:39,462 --> 01:00:43,712
転んでも這い上がって 夜に呑まれても
Even if you fall and crawl back up, swallowed by the night,

617
01:00:44,362 --> 01:00:48,962
流した涙さえ 力に変えていく
turn even the tears you shed into strength.

618
01:00:49,462 --> 01:00:52,962
この命 燃え上がれ
Blaze up, this life of mine!

619
01:00:54,062 --> 01:00:57,812
僕はまだ 終わりじゃない
I'm still not finished yet.

620
01:00:58,862 --> 01:01:02,912
何度でも 何度でも
No matter how many times, no matter how many times,

621
01:01:03,862 --> 01:01:08,812
僕だけの 人生を 始めよう
let's begin the life that is uniquely mine.

622
01:01:31,697 --> 01:01:33,437
ありがとうございました！
Thank you very much!

623
01:01:33,437 --> 01:01:36,517
生誕祭ライブ、いかがだったでしょうか？
How did you like the birthday live?

624
01:01:36,517 --> 01:01:38,637
楽しんでもらえていたら嬉しいです。
I hope you enjoyed it.

625
01:01:38,917 --> 01:01:41,437
ここでいくつか告知をさせてください。
Now, please allow me a few announcements.

626
01:01:41,577 --> 01:01:45,662
角巻わための新曲「Revival」が
Tsunomaki Watame's new single "Revival"

627
01:01:45,662 --> 01:01:49,837
このあとすぐホロライブチャンネルにてMV投稿されます
will have its MV posted on the Hololive channel shortly,

628
01:01:50,017 --> 01:01:52,617
そして、なんとこの後24時から
And what's more, starting at 24:00 tonight,

629
01:01:52,617 --> 01:01:54,537
楽曲配信もあります！
there will also be a song release!

630
01:01:54,737 --> 01:01:59,937
新曲「Revival」と「mayday, mayday」の2曲！
The two tracks: "Revival" and "mayday, mayday"!

631
01:01:59,937 --> 01:02:03,237
たくさん買って聴いてください。よろしくお願いします！
Please buy and listen to them a lot. Thank you!

632
01:02:03,477 --> 01:02:09,597
そして、お誕生日といえば！誕生日記念グッズが今年も出ます！
And speaking of birthdays! Birthday merch is out this year too!

633
01:02:09,797 --> 01:02:14,577
詳細はこらら！まずは「2層アクリルパネル」！
Details are here! First is the 2-Layer Acrylic Panel!

634
01:02:14,737 --> 01:02:19,537
今年もふみママに描き下ろししていただきました！
Drawn by Fumi-mama again this year!

635
01:02:19,537 --> 01:02:23,837
君と色違いのリュックを背負って海べデートがテーマです！
Theme is a beach date with matching backpacks!

636
01:02:24,157 --> 01:02:28,897
そして、わためと色違いの「わためとリュック」！
Next, the "Watame & Backpack" in matching colors!

637
01:02:28,897 --> 01:02:35,097
色は黒で大きめサイズ。だけど軽くて使いやすいです！
Black and fairly large, but light and easy to use!

638
01:02:35,397 --> 01:02:41,437
リュックにつけたりできる「缶バッジ」4種類1セット！
"Can Badges" for your backpack in a set of 4!

639
01:02:41,437 --> 01:02:47,137
どれも可愛いので、ぜひ身の回りのものにつけてください！
They're all cute, so please attach them to your things!

640
01:02:47,437 --> 01:02:54,637
さらに、「わためほっぺむにむにキーホルダー」！
Plus, the "Watame Squishy Cheek Keychain"!

641
01:02:54,637 --> 01:02:58,637
ほっぺをつかまれているわためがキーホルダーになりました！
Watame with her pinched cheeks became a keychain!

642
01:02:58,937 --> 01:03:06,617
フルセット購入特典は直筆サイン＆メッセージ入りポストカード！
Full set bonus: signed postcard with a message!

643
01:03:06,617 --> 01:03:13,217
数量制限なしで書かせていただきますので、ぜひ買ってね！
Written with no quantity limits, so please buy it!

644
01:03:13,417 --> 01:03:19,417
このあとすぐメンゲンライブもやりますのでぜひ見にきてね！
We'll also have a member-only live right after this!

645
01:03:19,577 --> 01:03:25,417
みんなが支えてくれるおかげで今年も色々なことに挑戦できています。
Thanks to your support, I can take on new challenges.

646
01:03:25,577 --> 01:03:32,557
いつも応援してくれるわためいとも、今日初めて知った方も、
To loyal Watamates and those who just discovered me today,

647
01:03:32,557 --> 01:03:36,337
8歳になったわためをこれからもよろしくお願いします！
please keep supporting 8-year-old Watame!

648
01:03:36,537 --> 01:03:43,557
ではメンゲンライブの準備をしてくるのでみんな待っててね！
I'll go prep for the live, so everyone wait for me!

649
01:03:43,717 --> 01:03:47,037
またあとでね！
See you later!

